// ============================================================================
// REAL migration engine (gated — see runMigration)
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Everything below only runs when `!SANDBOX && ENABLE_REAL_MIGRATION === "1"`.
// It orchestrates the whole transfer FROM THE TARGET Nxeon server: we open one
