// lib/sftp), then have the target PULL from the customer's source box using
// rsync/mysqldump/pg_dump over SSH (authenticated with sshpass + the decrypted
// source password). No plaintext secret is ever persisted — decrypted values
// live only in local variables and are scrubbed from the row by clearSecrets().
